# Sample audit-export output, one line per format.
#
# Every value below is fabricated. The event is a single denial of a navigate
# to example.invalid; the same event is shown encoded three ways so a SIEM
# integrator can write a parser without running the host. Field mapping tables
# are in docs/security.md.
#
# These are the exact bytes both hosts emit: the lines were produced by the
# host encoder (bridge.format_audit_export_line) and the Rust host produces the
# same bytes for the same event.
#
# Comment lines start with "#" and are NOT part of any real sink: a live sink
# receives only the encoded lines.
#
# --- format: jsonl -----------------------------------------------------------
# The audit event verbatim, compact, keys sorted. No field is added, so a sink
# can never receive something the local audit log does not already hold.
{"action":"navigate","client":"example-agent","decision":"deny","reason":"origin not allowed","requestId":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000","targets":["https://example.invalid","*://example.invalid"],"ts":1735689600123}
#
# --- format: syslog ----------------------------------------------------------
# RFC 5424. PRI 132 = facility local0 (16) * 8 + severity 4 (warning), used for
# the deny/blackout class; an allow is 134 (severity 6, informational).
# HOSTNAME and PROCID are the NILVALUE "-" on purpose: the machine name is not
# the agent's to publish. There is no MSG part, only structured data.
<132>1 2025-01-01T00:00:00.123Z - chrome-bridge - navigate [chromeBridge@0 client="example-agent" action="navigate" decision="deny" reason="origin not allowed" requestId="00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000" targets="https://example.invalid,*://example.invalid"]
#
# --- format: cef -------------------------------------------------------------
# ArcSight CEF:0. Header is Vendor|Product|Version|SignatureID|Name|Severity,
# where Version 1.0 is the audit-export SCHEMA version and Severity 7 is the
# deny/blackout class (an allow is 3).
CEF:0|ChromeBridge|NativeHost|1.0|deny|navigate|7|rt=1735689600123 suser=example-agent act=navigate outcome=deny externalId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000 reason=origin not allowed cs1Label=targets cs1=https://example.invalid,*://example.invalid
